# WordStar 3.00 (installed for ADM-3A) smoke test: create TEST.TXT, type
# two lines, save with ^KD. Run by tests/wordstar.sh.
@wait-idle
D
@wait-idle
TEST.TXT\r
@wait-idle
@dump ws-editor.dump
Hello from the 10 BIPS future.\rSecond line.\r
@wait-idle
\^K\^D
@wait-idle
@dump ws-after-save.dump
@end
